<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NORTHERNS 164 ALL OUT AT TEA VS TRANSVAAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NORTHERNS 164 ALL OUT AT TEA VS TRANSVAAL.</headline>
<dateline>CENTURION 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Transvaal, in reply to Transvaal's first innings of 201 for six declared, were bowled out for 164 on the stroke of tea on the final day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match at Centurion Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Transvaal 201-6 declared (Adam Bacher 102).</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal 164 all out in 65.4 overs (Roy Pienaar 55; Wayne Kidwell 4-58).</p>
